      <p>云南省体育局:依托区位资源优势，突出特色力求发展
</p>
       
            
     </div>
     <div class="banner">
      <span class="spa">发布时间：</span><span>2010-04-29</span>
      <span class="spa">来源：信息中心网站部 </span>
            <span class="spa">字体：</span><span class="ziti da">大</span><span class="ziti zhong">中</span><span class="ziti xiao">小</span>
       

